docker/services/ruby/scripts/generators/video_generator_grok.rb | FileUtils.mkdir_p(path) | shared-root | the shared folder itself
docker/services/ruby/scripts/generators/video_generator_gemini.rb | FileUtils.mkdir_p(path) | shared-root | the shared folder itself
docker/services/ruby/scripts/cli_tools/image_query.rb | File.binwrite(source, original) | system-temp | resize work folder (Dir.mktmpdir)
docker/services/ruby/lib/monadic/utils/shared_fs.rb | File.open(root, READ_FLAGS) | shared-root | opens the shared folder itself read-only (RDONLY, NOFOLLOW) to hold it
docker/services/ruby/lib/monadic/utils/shared_path_guard.rb | File.open(copy, "wb", 0o600) | system-temp | with_local_copy!: the copy in a new folder of its own in the system temp folder
